   L6524 ### 23.11 The refusal pattern carries four verdicts, not one
   L6525  §23.10.4 counts refusals and reads them as "a perturbation". The count is one number; the
   L6526  PATTERN is four.
   L6527 
   L6528   refusals                       V          what the family is doing
   L6529   none                           infinite   exact — linear in the parameter, two points suffice
   L6530   none                           finite     a smooth channel
   L6531   one                            finite     a bifurcation — the family changes character and does not return
   L6532   regularly spaced               finite     an oscillation — the family returns
   L6533   dense and irregular            undefine   chaotic
   L6534                                  d
   L6535 
   L6536  **An index does not see *a* refusal. It sees a family**, and the spacing of the refusals across it is what separates these. §16.7.1 makes the same move for a d
   L6537 
